/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Author (Rafael\040Alves\040da\040Silva\054\040Lucas\040N\056\040Ferreira)
/Title (A\040Holistic\040Recommendation\040System\040for\040Higher\040Education\040Academic\040Activities)
/Subject (Several\040recommender\040systems\040have\040been\040proposed\040to\040suggest\040courses\040to\040students\040based\040on\040their\040transcripts\056\040In\040this\040paper\054\040we\040evaluate\040whether\040these\040systems\040can\040be\040generalized\040to\040other\040academic\040activities\054\040such\040as\040research\040projects\040and\040extracurricular\040activities\056\040We\040follow\040previous\040grade\055aware\040and\040content\055based\040approaches\054\040where\040course\040descriptions\040are\040represented\040by\040embedding\040vectors\040to\040predict\040students\047\040grades\056\040We\040extend\040this\040method\040by\040representing\040other\040academic\040activities\040as\040embedding\040vectors\040in\040the\040same\040space\040as\040the\040course\040descriptions\040using\040Jina\054\040a\040recent\040BERT\055based\040embedding\040model\056\040This\040shared\040embedding\040space\040allows\040us\040to\040predict\040students\047\040potential\040\042grades\042\040for\040other\040academic\040activities\054\040different\040from\040courses\054\040which\040we\040interpret\040as\040their\040level\040of\040interest\056\040We\040first\040evaluate\040the\040Jina\040embeddings\040as\040features\040for\040predicting\040course\040grades\040compared\040to\040TF\055IDF\040and\040Word2Vec\056\040The\040results\040show\040that\040Jina\040embeddings\040outperform\040both\040for\040predicting\040course\040grades\056\040Using\040the\040Jina\040embeddings\040as\040shared\040space\040for\040academic\040activities\040representation\054\040we\040conducted\040a\040user\040study\040to\040evaluate\040our\040assumption\040that\040predicted\040grades\040are\040good\040proxies\040for\040student\040interests\056\040We\040asked\040students\040to\040rate\040recommendations\040for\040courses\054\040undergraduate\040research\040projects\054\040and\040community\040activities\040with\040respect\040to\040novelty\054\040diversity\054\040personalization\054\040accuracy\054\040and\040satisfaction\056\040The\040results\040indicate\040that\040students\040prefer\040our\040recommender\040system\040over\040a\040collaborative\040filtering\040baseline\040in\040all\040metrics\056)
>>
